# Finding E4 (differential testing, lockstep lines): the engine does not offer a cast that needs Cavern of Souls' restricted mana.
# Cavern of Souls (naming Merfolk) taps for one mana of any color, spendable only on a Merfolk creature spell. Thassa's Oracle is a Merfolk Wizard
# costing {U}{U}: Island + Cavern pays it. Forge offers `cast|Hand|Thassa's Oracle|` at this state; the engine offers only the land plays and
# mana abilities until the player taps Cavern by hand. Check with:  scnmenu e4-cavern-restricted-mana-cast-offer.scn
# Expected (Forge, and the rules): the menu contains cast|Hand|Thassa's Oracle|
=== cavern-restricted-mana-cast-offer
title: Island + Cavern of Souls (Merfolk) pay for Thassa's Oracle: the cast is offered
state:
  humanhand=Thassa's Oracle
  humanbattlefield=Cavern of Souls|ChosenType:Merfolk;Island
